{"seq":2,"slug":"withholding-reconciliation-refund-reversal","title":"平台代扣代缴对账、退款退货与税额冲销","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/filing-remittance-risk-operations/withholding-reconciliation-refund-reversal","wordCount":3045,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"平台代扣代缴对账-退款退货与税额冲销\">平台代扣代缴对账、退款退货与税额冲销</h1><p>一笔 2026 年 3 月售出、4 月才退回的订单，税额早在 3 月的申报表上缴给了法国税务局，退款却发生在 4 月。系统这一刻要回答四个问题：这笔税当初<strong>由谁收的</strong>（平台按 deemed supplier 代扣，还是商家自缴）、<strong>在哪张申报表上冲销</strong>、<strong>冲多少</strong>（部分退款如何按行拆回税额）、以及冲销后<strong>本辖区台账余额是否还能闭合</strong>。前三个决定现金流，第四个决定你下一轮会不会被稽查对上。本文只处理从退款事件到台账闭合这条链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-冲销依赖的身份三元组\">核心概念：冲销依赖的身份三元组</h2><p>税额冲销比计税更难，因为它操作的是<strong>已经申报过的历史</strong>。一笔冲销必须同时锚定三个量：<strong>征收主体</strong>（谁当初把税交给了税局）、<strong>申报期间</strong>（这笔税记在哪张表上）、<strong>更正凭证</strong>（用什么单据证明税额被合法调低）。任一维缺失都无法闭环——不知道主体会重复冲销，不知道期间无法决定更正历史还是本期净额，没有凭证则贷项在稽查时被否掉。</p>\n<p>另一个关键概念是<strong>事件流而非余额</strong>：稳健的税金台账是一串只追加的分录（<code>COLLECT</code> / <code>REVERSAL</code> / <code>REMIT</code> / <code>ADJUST</code>），余额由事件累加得出；跨期冲销需在保留<strong>原始期间应缴额</strong>不动的前提下另开本期反向分录，没有事件流，&quot;3 月申报的税额后来变了&quot;就说不清楚。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[退款/退货事件到达] --&gt; B{原始订单的征收主体}&#10;  B --&gt;|平台 deemed supplier / facilitator| C[平台侧申报表取贷项]&#10;  B --&gt;|商家自缴| D[商家侧申报表冲销]&#10;  C --&gt; E{是否同一申报期}&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[同期内直接净额冲减]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[跨期:更正原申报 或 后续期净额]&#10;  F --&gt; H[更新辖区台账余额]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{余额是否允许为负}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[结转下期或申请退税]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[滚动结转,不得申报负税额]\">graph TD\n  A[退款/退货事件到达] --&gt; B{原始订单的征收主体}\n  B --&gt;|平台 deemed supplier / facilitator| C[平台侧申报表取贷项]\n  B --&gt;|商家自缴| D[商家侧申报表冲销]\n  C --&gt; E{是否同一申报期}\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt;|是| F[同期内直接净额冲减]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[跨期:更正原申报 或 后续期净额]\n  F --&gt; H[更新辖区台账余额]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{余额是否允许为负}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[结转下期或申请退税]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[滚动结转,不得申报负税额]</pre><h2 id=\"冲销的第一原则-谁征收-谁冲销\">冲销的第一原则：谁征收，谁冲销</h2><p>最常见的工程事故不是算错，而是<strong>同一笔税被冲销了两次</strong>：平台按征收主体身份在自己的申报表上取了贷项，商家又在自缴申报表上取了一次。根因是订单数据里缺少一个显式字段——<strong>征收主体（collector of record）</strong>。跨境交易里&quot;谁把钱交给税务局&quot;由四类互斥规则决定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>征收主体</th>\n<th>冲销责任方</th>\n<th>典型依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台是 deemed supplier（IOSS，货值 ≤ €150）</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>平台，在其 IOSS 申报表冲销</td>\n<td>VAT Directive 2006/112/EC 第 369 septvicies 条；实施条例 EU 282/2011 第 9a 条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国 marketplace facilitator 法下平台代收</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>平台，在 facilitator 申报表取贷项</td>\n<td>SSUTA 及各州 facilitator 法（45 个有销售税的州 + DC 均已立法）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商家自建站自缴（无平台介入）</td>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>商家，在自缴申报表冲销</td>\n<td>各州销售税法 / 欧盟成员国增值税法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台仅提供收款通道（非 facilitator）</td>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>合同与各州 facilitator 法适用范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>征收主体必须是行级、不可变的属性</strong>，在结算时刻写死，而不是事后靠 <code>channel == &#39;marketplace&#39;</code> 这种可被配置修改的布尔去推断。平台代扣场景下，退款由平台先垫付给买家、再向税局取贷项，商家侧的台账里这笔税<strong>从未出现过</strong>；若商家侧也生成冲销分录，两个台账永远对不平。判定在欧洲尤其易错：IOSS 只覆盖<strong>内在价值（intrinsic value）≤ €150</strong> 的进口货物，超 €150 的平台不是 deemed supplier。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨期冲销-同期更正与后续期净额\">跨期冲销：同期更正与后续期净额</h2><p>退款落在哪个申报期，决定冲销是&quot;改动历史&quot;还是&quot;本期净额消化&quot;。两条路径的<strong>法定窗口和审计后果完全不同</strong>，必须建模成可配置策略而非硬编码。<strong>欧盟侧</strong>，IOSS 与 OSS 申报表按月提交，截止日为<strong>次月最后一天</strong>。同期退货直接在当期净额冲减；跨期则 VAT Directive 允许在<strong>后续期申报表</strong>更正，而不是重开已提交的历史申报表。工程含义：冲销天然是&quot;<strong>前期借记 + 本期贷记</strong>&quot;，原始期间应缴额保持不变。</p>\n<p><strong>美国侧</strong>，SSUTA 第 330 条给了一条 60 天硬窗口：卖方须在退货后 60 天内把税款退还给买方才能取得贷项；超期未退的<strong>失去贷项</strong>，只能由买方自行申请退款。加州 CDTFA 第 1700 号条例更细——要求卖方<strong>实际退还多收税款</strong>，或取得买方<strong>签字的退款请求权转让（assignment of refund claim）</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>欧盟 IOSS/OSS</th>\n<th>美国各州销售税</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>申报频率</td>\n<td>月度，次月最后一天截止</td>\n<td>月/季/年，按州与销售额分档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨期冲销路径</td>\n<td>后续期申报表净额更正</td>\n<td>下一申报期贷项；部分州允许更正原申报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取贷项前置条件</td>\n<td>已开具更正发票（credit note）</td>\n<td>已实际退款给买方或取得转让同意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬性窗口</td>\n<td>无统一 60 天规则，受追溯期约束</td>\n<td>SSUTA 第 330 条 60 天窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追溯上限</td>\n<td>各成员国 3–4 年（如德国 AO §169 为 4 年）</td>\n<td>多数州 3–4 年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>欧盟这条路径还有一个<strong>发票耦合</strong>：税额向下调整必须通过<strong>更正发票（corrective invoice / credit note）<strong>落地，它需引用原发票号、注明冲销原因，并纳入</strong>连续无缺号</strong>的发票序列（VAT Directive 第 226 条）。冲销同时生成一张受发票规则约束的单据；若把发票序列与税款台账做成两套独立 ID，冲销时必然出现&quot;台账扣了、发票没开&quot;的裂隙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部分退款与运费-按行拆回税额的算法\">部分退款与运费：按行拆回税额的算法</h2><p>整单退款最简单——把原订单所有行的税额逐行取反即可。真正需要算法的是<strong>部分退款</strong>：退一件、退运费、或只退一笔善意补偿。原则是&quot;<strong>退款金额先按行拆成含税毛额，再逐行剥离净额与税额</strong>&quot;，而非用一个混合税率去除。设订单行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 原始含税毛额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，退款总毛额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>order</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>net</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>tax</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>net</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i = R \\times \\frac{g_i}{\\sum_{j \\in \\text{order}} g_j}, \\qquad \\text{net}_i = \\frac{x_i}{1 + v_i}, \\qquad \\text{tax}_i = x_i - \\text{net}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2294em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tax</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>必须有<strong>行级税率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 逐行算，不能用订单平均税率。19% 与 7% 两行混在一张单里时，同样的 50 欧元退款在两行上剥离出的税额不同；用混合税率会让冲销额偏离实际已缴税额，逐期累积成对账尾差。运费同理——运费在欧盟口径下并入税基（VAT Directive 第 78 条），在美国则<strong>按辖区</strong>判定是否应税，因此运费退款也要按其所属辖区规则剥离。</p>\n<p>分摊的<strong>舍入尾差</strong>必须用确定性方法归集：先取每行精确值的整数部分，剩余最小货币单位数按小数部分从大到小逐行发放（最大余数法），保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>round</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i \\text{round}(x_i) = R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 恒成立。这套按行拆分与尾差归集，与 <a href=\"../checkout-collection-invoice-record/line-level-tax-base-apportionment\">逐行税额计算、税基拆分与运费折扣分摊</a> 用的是同一组原语，差异只在方向（正向计税 vs 反向退税），两者必须共用同一套舍入实现。边界情形：<strong>只退运费</strong>时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取该行分得的运费份额；<strong>折扣已分摊的订单</strong>按<strong>折后</strong>毛额分摊；<strong>换货</strong>是两笔独立交易——先开更正发票冲销原供应，再对换出商品开新发票计新税。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三方勾稽-台账-渠道收款与申报缴纳必须闭合\">三方勾稽：台账、渠道收款与申报缴纳必须闭合</h2><p>对账的本质是一个<strong>恒等式</strong>。对每个辖区 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span>，把台账事件分成征收、冲销、缴纳三类，任何时点都须满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi></munder><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi></munder><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi></munder><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>Adj</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_p C_{j,p} - \\sum_p R_{j,p} - \\sum_p F_{j,p} + \\text{Adj}_j = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4361em;vertical-align:-1.3861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4361em;vertical-align:-1.3861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4361em;vertical-align:-1.3861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Adj</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是已征收、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是已冲销、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是已申报缴纳、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Adj</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Adj}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Adj</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是期初或迁移时的登记差额。不平指向具体断点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>断点</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渠道收款 vs 计税台账</td>\n<td>渠道实收税额 &gt; 台账计税</td>\n<td>结算时税率缓存过期、汇率差异、手工改价未回写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计税台账 vs 冲销台账</td>\n<td>退款有金额无税、或税不对应原行</td>\n<td>部分退款走了混合税率、或冲销未关联原发票</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲销台账 vs 申报表</td>\n<td>申报贷项 &lt; 台账冲销额</td>\n<td>跨期冲销受&quot;负税额下限&quot;截断，剩余未结转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申报表 vs 缴款凭证</td>\n<td>申报税额 ≠ 实缴金额</td>\n<td>多辖区合并缴纳、抵扣项未分离、缴款币种折算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行的<strong>负税额下限</strong>是必须显式建模的约束：多数辖区<strong>不允许申报表出现负应缴税额</strong>。当某期退款冲销额超过当期征收额，超出部分只能在本辖区<strong>滚动结转（carry-forward）<strong>到下期，或满足条件后单独申请退税；若直接算成负数缴款，这笔钱实际不会退回，台账却记成已冲销。渠道侧同理：平台代扣下买家退款由</strong>平台垫付</strong>，平台现金流量表与它的税局贷项存在时间差；商家侧台账对<strong>征收主体不是自己的订单根本不生成分录</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"坏账-拒付与不可退税\">坏账、拒付与不可退税</h2><p>不是所有&quot;税回不来&quot;都能作为冲销入账。</p>\n<p><strong>坏账减免（bad debt relief）</strong>：VAT Directive 第 90(2) 条允许成员国对未收款情况作例外规定，能否减免、条件（逾期多久、是否已追偿）<strong>因成员国而异</strong>，多数成员国只对 B2B 在特定条件下开放，<strong>B2C 通常不适用</strong>。它不是&quot;退款事件&quot;驱动，而是<strong>周期性认定</strong>动作，需独立的规则开关与时间条件。</p>\n<p><strong>拒付 / 争议（chargeback）</strong>：支付渠道拒付在税务上<strong>不等于退货</strong>——货物可能从未退回、买家仍持有商品，多数辖区<strong>不允许因拒付直接冲销已缴税额</strong>，除非同时满足退货或坏账减免的实体条件。此外，平台代扣下当平台是征收主体且已缴税，个别州对贷项设有额外门槛（如贷项超过一定金额才能申请现金退税），应作为<strong>辖区策略参数</strong>存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地-事件模型-幂等与审计留痕\">工程落地：事件模型、幂等与审计留痕</h2><p>把逻辑落成系统，核心是把税金维护成<strong>只追加的事件流（append-only ledger）</strong>，而非可变余额表。每条分录携带类型、辖区、期间、金额、币种、关联的原始交易 ID 与发票 ID：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件类型</th>\n<th>触发源</th>\n<th>关键字段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>DETERMINE</code></td>\n<td>结算</td>\n<td>辖区、税率、税基、规则版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>COLLECT</code></td>\n<td>收款成功</td>\n<td>渠道流水号、币种、汇率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>REVERSAL</code></td>\n<td>退款/退货/更正</td>\n<td>原发票 ID、更正发票 ID、跨期标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>REMIT</code></td>\n<td>缴款完成</td>\n<td>申报表 ID、缴款凭证号、实缴币种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ADJUST</code></td>\n<td>期初/迁移/审计调整</td>\n<td>原因码、审批人、留痕附件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>必须写进设计的约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>幂等</strong>：退款事件以 <code>refund_id</code> 为幂等键——同一订单可多次部分退款，重复事件必须去重，否则同一笔税被冲销两次。</li>\n<li><strong>征收主体冻结</strong>：<code>COLLECT</code> 落库后征收主体不可改，纠正时用 <code>ADJUST</code> 追加反向分录。</li>\n<li><strong>更正发票与冲销同事务</strong>：<code>REVERSAL</code> 与更正发票生成须落在同一事务或最终一致的消息组。</li>\n<li><strong>辖区策略外置</strong>：跨期路径、60 天窗口、负税额、结转规则、追溯期按辖区配置读取。</li>\n<li><strong>不可变审计留痕</strong>：每条 <code>REVERSAL</code> 可回溯到哪张原发票、哪张更正发票、哪笔退款凭证，并附触发它的征收主体判定记录。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>税额冲销的难点从不在乘法，而在三个身份维度的对齐：<strong>谁收的税</strong>（征收主体，必须行级冻结）、<strong>记在哪个期间</strong>（决定跨期更正还是本期净额）、<strong>用什么凭证冲</strong>（更正发票或买方转让书，受发票序列与窗口约束）。把税金维护成只追加的事件流、把辖区规则外置为策略、把退款幂等键绑到 <code>refund_id</code>，对账恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>Adj</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum C - \\sum R - \\sum F + \\text{Adj} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Adj</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 自然闭合。税率由 <a href=\"../tax-determination-engine/sourcing-category-rate-resolution\">原产地/消费地判定与品类税率解析</a> 决定，税基由结算层拆好，冲销环节唯一不能出错的，就是身份与顺序。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"平台代扣代缴对账、退款退货与税额冲销","id":"平台代扣代缴对账-退款退货与税额冲销"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：冲销依赖的身份三元组","id":"核心概念-冲销依赖的身份三元组"},{"level":2,"text":"冲销的第一原则：谁征收，谁冲销","id":"冲销的第一原则-谁征收-谁冲销"},{"level":2,"text":"跨期冲销：同期更正与后续期净额","id":"跨期冲销-同期更正与后续期净额"},{"level":2,"text":"部分退款与运费：按行拆回税额的算法","id":"部分退款与运费-按行拆回税额的算法"},{"level":2,"text":"三方勾稽：台账、渠道收款与申报缴纳必须闭合","id":"三方勾稽-台账-渠道收款与申报缴纳必须闭合"},{"level":2,"text":"坏账、拒付与不可退税","id":"坏账-拒付与不可退税"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地：事件模型、幂等与审计留痕","id":"工程落地-事件模型-幂等与审计留痕"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"申报周期、报表口径与多辖区税额归集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/filing-remittance-risk-operations/filing-cycle-report-aggregation"},"next":{"title":"税务稽查、罚则与审计留痕风控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/filing-remittance-risk-operations/audit-penalty-evidence-controls"}}